// r454: TABS IN THE TITLE BAR. WS_CAPSTRIP 1 = the window paints its own title strip (the buffer grows upward by the strip height,
// the window keeps its outer size, the program gets an E_RESIZE); 0 = back to the server's title bar. WS_DRAGX declares the empty
// part of the strip: value = x0 | (x1 << 32) in client coordinates, a press there moves the window (docs/COMPOSITOR.md).
const WS_CAPSTRIP: u64 = 5
